{"id": "EUVD-2026-108648", "enisaUuid": "523cc0d9-98f9-3f84-981f-14047e01970a", "description": "`LoadPublicKey` resolved an EC key's curve with an unchecked type assertion, `algToOptsMap[alg].(*ECDSAOptions)`. A JWK declaring `\"kty\":\"EC\"` together with a non-EC `\"alg\"` \u2014 which RFC 7517 \u00a74.4 permits \u2014 reaches that assertion and **panics**.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T08:48:08", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T08:48:08", "baseScore": 6.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/eclipse-keypont/gose/security/advisories/GHSA-fv39-8484-f4wr"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89316"], "assigner": "eclipse", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "671f33c1-3ed3-32bd-9d65-5c3308b62262", "product": {"name": "Eclipse KeyPont - GOSE", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0.7.3 \u22640.13.0-rc1"}, {"id": "9323e720-463e-3df1-811e-9331edb30c46", "product": {"name": "Eclipse KeyPont - GOSE", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.0.0-rc4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a126c087-5a48-3f14-aaf6-95d16c3d8163", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}